title: Kirana_Talk
---
<<if $met_kirana>>
    Kirana: Back again?
<<else>>
    Kirana: Oh! A customer. Welcome in.
    <<set $met_kirana to true>>
<<endif>>
Kirana: What can I do for you?
-> What do you sell?
    Kirana: Snacks, soap, phone credit. The usual.
-> Any news around town?
    Kirana: They say the old pier lights up at sunrise.
    Kirana: Never seen it myself.
-> Nothing, just looking.
Kirana: Come back anytime.
===

title: Kirana_Examine
---
A small corner shop. The sign is hand-painted.
===
